From 90f9d0c7d1dd566b49918ae05bde174cbb3ad97b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:48:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: paint the bottom tab sheet with the live bar colour

The bottom-bar tab sheet used a hardcoded purple-seed container
(#F1EDF6 / #1C1A20) and blended the bottom button bar toward it, so the
sheet read pink against the bar. The page card backdrop also showed
black in the gesture inset while the sheet was up.

The bottom-bar sheet, seam and action row now take the opaque colour the
bottom bar actually paints (bottom bar, toolbar, control container,
then the incognito-aware surface container high). The pill and search
field follow the omnibox fill. The toolbar is no longer blended while
the sheet is up. The navigation bar blends to the sheet surface with
progress and is restored on close; the page backdrop is clipped off the
navigation inset and the page parent is painted with the sheet colour.

Top-bar sheet and the side drawer keep their colours.
